<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Group Critical-token Policy Optimization for
<br class="ltx_break">Autoregressive Image Generation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Guohui Zhang
